      "@type": "cat-harness:Tool",
      "description": "The tools layer's reusable `layer-translation-adjudication.yml`, called by a layer on `issues` events: runs once per issue labelled `translation-adjudication` or titled `[translation review] …`, mounts the platform's layers, runs `translation:adjudicate` on the event, and either commits the records on `translation-adjudication/issue-<n>` (authored by the issue's author) and opens a ready PR, or comments why nothing was recorded. It never merges.",
